    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Jordan's Garden Webpage\r\n_\"I want to make a webpage about the community garden because I want more people to know about it. I want a photo of the garden and some text underneath. The writing should be large and easy to read, and the photo should have a frame around it.\"_\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/a4538a503f15ec329cb5e25ffb113c68-image-1775016920582.png\" style=\"width: 40%\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Build:** Use the AI Tutor to create this page step by step. Remember to be precise with your prompts!\r\n2. **Refine:** Keep prompting until your page is close to Jordan's vision. It doesn't need to be perfect - just similar!\r\n\r\n> **Hint:** Try using `<p>` and `<img>` tags for structure, and `font-size` and `border` for style. Not sure how? Just ask AI Tutor!\r\n \r\nWhen you're happy with the result, click **Continue**.",
