          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "Riverside Community Garden\n\nThe Riverside Community Garden has been a gathering place for our neighborhood since 2008. Volunteers of all ages come together to grow vegetables, flowers, and herbs. The garden is open to everyone and offers free plots to local families who want to grow their own food.\n\nThe garden hosts events every Saturday morning, including workshops on composting, seed saving, and seasonal planting. It's one of the most vibrant spots in the neighborhood.",
